**Type definition** in `/home/serhii/.vadd/worktrees/a2300d77-2915-456c-a5cc-7896c3517ae6/3e2d43ec-f9ae-4476-8f9e-009bb1c90a50/frontend/vendor/integration/utils/configBuilder.ts`:

```typescript
export interface UIConfig {
  theme: string;
}

const getUI = (config: Config) => {
  const _default = {
    theme: 'system',
  };
  return merge({}, _default, config?.ui ?? {});
};
```

Supported values:
- `"system"` — respects OS dark mode preference (default)
- `"light"` — always light, but user can toggle
- `"dark"` — always dark, but user can toggle
- `"light:only"` — forced light, no toggle button
- `"dark:only"` — forced dark (current setting), no toggle button

---

### 2. **Where the `dark` Class is Toggled**

The `dark` class is toggled in **two places**:

#### **A. On initial page load** — `/home/serhii/.vadd/worktrees/a2300d77-2915-456c-a5cc-7896c3517ae6/3e2d43ec-f9ae-4476-8f9e-009bb1c90a50/frontend/src/components/common/ApplyColorMode.astro`:

```javascript
<script is:inline define:vars={{ defaultTheme: UI.theme || 'system' }}>
  function applyTheme(theme) {
    if (theme === 'dark') {
      document.documentElement.classList.add('dark');
    } else {
      document.documentElement.classList.remove('dark');
    }
    // Updates checkbox state if toggle exists
    const matches = document.querySelectorAll('[data-aw-toggle-color-scheme] > input');
    if (matches && matches.length) {
      matches.forEach((elem) => {
        elem.checked = theme !== 'dark';
      });
    }
  }

  if ((defaultTheme && defaultTheme.endsWith(':only')) || (!localStorage.theme && defaultTheme !== 'system')) {
    applyTheme(defaultTheme.replace(':only', ''));
  } else if (
    localStorage.theme === 'dark' ||
    (!('theme' in localStorage) && window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches)
  ) {
    applyTheme('dark');
  } else {
    applyTheme('light');
  }
</script>
```

This script:
- Runs **before DOM rendering** (marked `is:inline`)
- Applies theme based on: config > localStorage > OS preference
- Syncs any existing toggle button checkbox state

#### **B. On user toggle** — `/home/serhii/.vadd/worktrees/a2300d77-2915-456c-a5cc-7896c3517ae6/3e2d43ec-f9ae-4476-8f9e-009bb1c90a50/frontend/src/components/common/BasicScripts.astro`:

```javascript
attachEvent('[data-aw-toggle-color-scheme]', 'click', function () {
  if (defaultTheme.endsWith(':only')) {
    return; // Disabled if theme is forced (":only")
  }

  Observer.removeAnimationDelay();

  document.documentElement.classList.toggle('dark');
  localStorage.theme = document.documentElement.classList.contains('dark') ? 'dark' : 'light';
});
```

This handles runtime toggle clicks, persisting the preference to localStorage.

